msgid "Data directory"
msgstr "数据目录"

msgid "Open a folder or file"
msgstr "打开文件夹或文件"

msgid "Terrain3D now stores data in a directory instead of a single file. Each region is stored in a separate file named `terrain3d[-_]##[-_]##.res`. For instance, the region at location (-1, 1) would be named `terrain3d-01_01.res`. Enable Terrain3D / Debug / Show Region Labels for a visual display."
msgstr "Terrain3D 将数据保存在目录中，每个地区单独存为 `terrain3d[-_]##[-_]##.res` 文件。例如 (-1, 1) 地区对应 `terrain3d-01_01.res`。可在 Terrain3D / Debug / Show Region Labels 中显示地区标签。"

msgid "\nSpecify the directory to store your data. Any existing region files will be loaded."
msgstr "\n指定地形数据的保存目录；目录内已有的地区文件也会被加载。"

msgid "Bake Terrain3D Mesh"
msgstr "烘焙 Terrain3D 网格"

msgid "This will create a child MeshInstance3D. LOD4+ is recommended. LOD0 is slow and dense with vertices every 1 unit. It is not an optimal mesh."
msgstr "这将创建 MeshInstance3D 子节点。建议使用 LOD4 或更高等级。LOD0 每单位一个顶点，网格密集、生成较慢，并非经过优化的网格。"

msgid "This will create a child OccluderInstance3D. LOD4+ is recommended and will take 5+ seconds per region to generate. LOD0 is unnecessarily dense and slow."
msgstr "这将创建 OccluderInstance3D 子节点。建议使用 LOD4 或更高等级，每个地区可能需要 5 秒以上。LOD0 过于密集，生成也较慢。"

